Lakṣmaṇa spends night at Gōmatī and reaches Ayōdhyā at midday --- Lakṣmaṇa dreads telling Rāma about Sītā --- Lakṣmaṇa sees Rāma seated tearful on throne --- Lakṣmaṇa grasps feet and reports leaving Sītā at Vālmīki hermitage --- Lakṣmaṇa preaches impermanence and urges no grief --- Rāma approves Lakṣmaṇa and feels comforted